WEBVTT

00:28:59.006 --> 00:29:02.054
Do you see a best of both worlds
possibility here?

00:29:02.078 --> 00:29:04.811
SC: In terms of the best of both worlds,

00:29:04.835 --> 00:29:09.048
a workspace where it really
is a combination between social spaces

00:29:09.072 --> 00:29:11.283
and then lots of private spaces

00:29:11.307 --> 00:29:13.665
that people can get access to
as they need them,

00:29:13.689 --> 00:29:17.433
and you can move freely back and forth
between those spaces throughout the day.

00:29:17.457 --> 00:29:20.335
CA: Well, after your talk,
we moved offices.

00:29:20.359 --> 00:29:22.400
We moved into these offices we're in now.

00:29:22.424 --> 00:29:24.137
SC: Yeah, which I love, by the way.

00:29:24.161 --> 00:29:27.304
CA: And your talk prompted
a long conversation

00:29:27.328 --> 00:29:31.140
among the leadership team here about,
you know, how on earth should we do this?